      "message": "Doing this conditionally doesn\u0027t seem like the right solution. It does seem to work here, but I don\u0027t think it will pass the test of time. Plus, I would like to keep gn_utils as generic as possible (though I understand that this isn\u0027t always possible) and put Soong specific hacks into gen_android_bp.\n\nSource sets are interesting as they almost always behave like a static library, except when they don\u0027t (https://gn.googlesource.com/gn/+/master/docs/reference.md#func_source_set). Looking into this more, it seems that Soong has an exact equivalent in cc_object. cc_object runs the compiler without running the linker, which is (I think) exactly what source_set does. Maybe let\u0027s try to use that instead?",
